# Visual Studio C++ build output and local IDE state.
# Only sources, project files and solutions belong in the repository; see README.md.

# Solution build output: LecNN/x64/<Configuration>/<Project>/ (OutDir)
x64/

# Per-project intermediate files: LecNN/<Project>/obj/ (IntDir)
obj/

# CMake "Open Folder" output of Lec16/Score
out/

# Local IDE state: .ipch, Browse.VC.db, .suo, CopilotIndices
.vs/

# Per-user project settings. Anything a reader needs — such as the debugger working
# directory of the Lec15 examples — is set in the .vcxproj instead.
*.vcxproj.user
*.vcxproj.filters

# Build artefacts if a project is ever built beside its sources
*.obj
*.exe
*.pdb
*.ilk
*.idb
*.exp
*.lib
*.ifc

# Demo data of the Lec15 file examples: every program recreates its own input
# on each run (lecture 15), so none of these is a checked-in fixture.
/Lec15/grades-demo.csv
/Lec15/grades-report.txt
/Lec15/accounts-demo.dat
/Lec15/directory-demo/